{
  "name": "01 - Lead Intake and AI Scoring",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 - Lead intake & AI scoring\nWebsite form POSTs a lead here. We answer **200 right away**, AI scores the lead 1-10, hot leads ping Slack, and **every** lead is logged to Google Sheets.\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Create credentials: *Google Sheets OAuth2*, *Slack*, and a *Header Auth* credential named **Groq API** (header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer gsk_...` = your Groq API key).\n2. Open the **Config** node and fill in `sheetId`, `sheetName`, `slackChannelId`.\n3. Give the sheet this header row: Date, Name, Email, Company, Website, Budget, Message, Score, Reason, Next step, Hot, Source, AI status.\n4. Click *Listen for test event* on the Webhook, send the curl from the README, then activate.\n5. Point your form (Webflow / WordPress / Typeform webhook) at the **Production URL**.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "72eebe54-c975-5f40-a8ae-3ad8a79f9f61",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI step: Groq via HTTP Request\nCalls Groq's OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API (`/openai/v1/chat/completions`) with `response_format: json_object`, 3 retries and a fallback, so an AI outage never drops a record.\nModel = **Config -> aiModel** (default `openai/gpt-oss-120b`). Alternatives: `openai/gpt-oss-20b` (faster/cheaper), `qwen/qwen3.8-27b` (third option).\nCredential: Header Auth **Groq API** (`Authorization` = `Bearer gsk_...`).\nGemini or OpenAI instead? Change the URL + body shape (see workflows README).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "17afb8c5-fd46-5f96-82ee-975d0a02705d",
      "name": "AI Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1090,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
