              "value": "B2B companies with 5-200 employees that want to automate manual sales or operations work. A stated budget above $2,000 is a strong signal. Students, job seekers, agencies reselling our service and spam score low.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
